{"id":"fb8cb910f74c1948","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-measure5-probability-kernel.md","title":"ZFC Measure5 Probability Kernel","display":"df-zfc-measure5-probability-kernel — ZFC Measure5 Probability Kernel","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure5-probability-kernel","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure5-probability-kernel","58-df-zfc-measure10-probability-kernel","58-df-zfc-measure3-probability-kernel","58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-kernel"],"display":"df-zfc-measure5-probability-kernel — ZFC Measure5 Probability Kernel","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-probability.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure5-probability-kernel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure5-probability-kernel</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure10-probability-kernel</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure3-probability-kernel</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-kernel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure5-probability-kernel — ZFC Measure5 Probability Kernel"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-probability.md\">../batch08/58-df-probability.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,K\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,K\\in V\\)</span> (measurable spaces and kernel)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> (sigma-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\\)</span> (probability-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-probability.md\">../batch08/58-df-probability.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5ProbabilityKernel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5ProbabilityKernel}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}probability\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5ProbabilityKernel}_S(X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B,K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\\land\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(K,X,[0,1]^{\\mathcal B})\\land\n\\left[\\forall x\\in X\\;\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(K(x),Y,\\mathcal B)\\right]\\land\n\\left[\n\\forall E\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n\\bigl(\\{x\\in X\\mid K(x)(E)&gt;r\\}\\in\\mathcal A\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}probability\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5ProbabilityKernel}_S(X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B,K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\\land\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(K,X,[0,1]^{\\mathcal B})\\land\n\\left[\\forall x\\in X\\;\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(K(x),Y,\\mathcal B)\\right]\\land\n\\left[\n\\forall E\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n\\bigl(\\{x\\in X\\mid K(x)(E)&gt;r\\}\\in\\mathcal A\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A probability kernel assigns probability measures with measurable evaluations.</li>\n<li>概率测度是从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]\">\\([0,1]\\)</span> 的集合函数，因此 kernel 的显式集合值域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]^{\\mathcal B}\">\\([0,1]^{\\mathcal B}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-probability.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-probability.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}$ (sigma-algebra predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-probability.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}$ (probability-measure predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-probability.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,K\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5ProbabilityKernel}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}probability\\text{-}kernel} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5ProbabilityKernel}_S(X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B,K)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\\land\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal B,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(K,X,[0,1]^{\\mathcal B})\\land\n\\left[\\forall x\\in X\\;\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(K(x),Y,\\mathcal B)\\right]\\land\n\\left[\n\\forall E\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\n\\bigl(\\{x\\in X\\mid K(x)(E)>r\\}\\in\\mathcal A\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"[0,1]^{\\mathcal B}","display":false}],"bytes":1716,"backlinks":[{"id":"b11853a4f3d4652b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5ProbabilityKernel}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (probability-kernel predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure5-probability-kernel.md]])"},{"id":"bcfe8ad142dea69c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_o